{"id":"sento","name":{"zh":"潮之汤","en":"SHIO BATHHOUSE"},"w":16,"h":10,"floor":"floor.png","solid":["1111111111111111","1111111111111111","1111111111111111","1111011111001111","1110000100000111","1000110110110001","1000000111000001","1111001000001111","1000000000100001","1111111001111111"],"things":[{"key":"partition","image":"things/partition.png","x":224,"y":128,"w":64,"h":96,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"clock","image":"things/clock.png","x":242,"y":130,"w":28,"h":56,"frames":4,"fps":2},{"key":"bandai","image":"things/bandai.png","x":224,"y":224,"w":64,"h":90,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"scale","image":"things/scale.png","x":102,"y":128,"w":20,"h":46,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"fan-m","image":"things/fan-m.png","x":160,"y":128,"w":32,"h":48,"frames":3,"fps":10},{"key":"milk","image":"things/milk.png","x":192,"y":128,"w":32,"h":62,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"shelf-m","image":"things/shelf-m.png","x":32,"y":160,"w":64,"h":62,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"bench-m","image":"things/bench-m.png","x":128,"y":192,"w":64,"h":32,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"fan-f","image":"things/fan-f.png","x":288,"y":128,"w":32,"h":48,"frames":3,"fps":10},{"key":"shelf-f","image":"things/shelf-f.png","x":416,"y":160,"w":64,"h":62,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"bench-f","image":"things/bench-f.png","x":320,"y":192,"w":64,"h":32,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"plant","image":"things/plant.png","x":288,"y":224,"w":32,"h":58,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"kyodai","image":"things/kyodai.png","x":384,"y":128,"w":32,"h":66,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"lockers","image":"things/lockers.png","x":34,"y":256,"w":94,"h":56,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"lockers-2","image":"things/lockers-2.png","x":384,"y":256,"w":94,"h":56,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"crate","image":"things/crate.png","x":194,"y":256,"w":30,"h":26,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"umbrellas","image":"things/umbrellas.png","x":324,"y":288,"w":24,"h":28,"frames":1,"fps":0}],"spawn":{"x":256,"y":278,"dir":"up"},"exit":[[7,9],[8,9]],"interact":[{"id":"mural-day","label":"看看瓷砖画","cells":[[2,2],[3,2],[4,2]],"anchor":[110,10],"first":"瓷砖一块块拼成一幅画：蓝的海、一座小岛、岛顶上白色的灯塔。灯塔那一块的颜色比旁边新，像是后来补上去的。"},{"id":"mural-dusk","label":"看看瓷砖画","cells":[[11,2],[12,2],[13,2]],"anchor":[402,10],"first":"这边的画是傍晚：同一座小岛，天是橘红的，灯塔已经亮了。男汤那边是白天——两边合起来，是一整天。"},{"id":"bandai","label":"付钱，聊两句","cells":[[7,5],[8,5],[7,6],[8,6]],"anchor":[256,130],"first":"阿姨从番台上探出身子，收下硬币，往你手心里放了一块小毛巾。零钱盘磨得发亮，旁边摊着一本记账的本子。"},{"id":"scale","label":"称一称","cells":[[3,3]],"anchor":[112,78],"first":"踩上去，秤盘咯噔一沉，大表盘的指针晃了三下才停。表盘玻璃上有一道裂纹，正好横在你的体重上。"},{"id":"milk","label":"买一瓶牛乳","cells":[[6,3]],"anchor":[208,62],"first":"玻璃门一拉开，冷气扑到手腕上。三排玻璃瓶：白的牛乳、咖啡牛乳、果汁牛乳。纸瓶盖要用旁边挂着的小针挑开。"},{"id":"locker","label":"把鞋放进鞋柜","cells":[[1,7],[2,7],[3,7]],"anchor":[81,196],"first":"抽出木牌，柜门「咔」一声锁上了。木牌上的号码被手摸得发黑。旁边一格的木牌插得好好的，落了一层薄灰。"}],"seats":[{"id":"bench-m-1","x":144,"y":186,"dir":"up"},{"id":"bench-m-2","x":176,"y":186,"dir":"up"},{"id":"bench-f-1","x":336,"y":186,"dir":"up"},{"id":"bench-f-2","x":368,"y":186,"dir":"up"}],"npcs":[{"id":"attendant","x":256,"y":154,"dir":"down"}],"windows":[],"lights":[{"x":256,"y":136,"r":120,"color":"#ffe2a8"},{"x":112,"y":136,"r":160,"color":"#fff0c8"},{"x":384,"y":136,"r":160,"color":"#fff0c8"},{"x":256,"y":256,"r":140,"color":"#ffd9a0"}],"floorType":"wood","music":"sento"}